// ================================================================
//  NHIEM VU 3 — create(), sua tay, chay vong tron             (on 18D, 18E, review)
//  Buoc a: npm run dev -- nv3-tao
//    TODO trong nv3Tao: sinh file migration, in fileName, diff.up, diff.down.
//    DU DOAN: file sinh ra co cau rename nao khong? ->
//    CAU HOI: sau create(), DB nv3 co bi doi khong? ->
//  Buoc b: viet ham vongTron (o duoi). Chay npm run dev -- nv3-chay, CHUA sua file migration.
//    DU DOAN du lieu sau up(): ->
//  Buoc c: mo file src/bt18/nv3/MigrationXXXX.ts, sua ca up() VA down(). Chay lai nv3-chay.
